WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
You are Eames.

00:03.000 --> 00:10.000
Inside the dream, Fischer has reached his father's bedside.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
His father's safe is still closed.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
Fischer is the only one who can give you the combination.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Get him to say it before the dream collapses.
